WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.050
To find an order, go to Orders, and open the All Orders tab.

00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:07.521
Type a PO number or part number in the search box.

00:00:07.972 --> 00:00:09.140
Or click Filter.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:14.398
For example, to see late orders, pick Past ship date, under Ship timing.

00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:22.757
Click a PO number to see everything about that order.

00:00:23.276 --> 00:00:24.983
Close it to go back to the list.
